  (text "Fixed 3.3 V / 1 A regulator, VIN rated 3-17 V.\n3.3 uH; 30 uF nominal local output capacitance.\nPG holds MCU reset until regulation; route VOS as a Kelvin sense."
    (at 205 244 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "5bd72f89-8ae4-51d2-bda4-3de2fec24cb5"))
  (text "5 V sink only; no PD negotiation. Internal Rd includes dead-battery attach.\nPORT=GND; EN_N=GND; ADDR=NC selects GPIO mode. No extra Rd resistors.\nCC output pull-ups use the same 3.3 V supply as the detector."
    (at 20 111 0)
